<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000T U.S. soybeans, corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000T U.S. soybeans, corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp would tender on Wednesday for a combined shipment of 20,000 tonnes of No.2 or better U.S. yellow corn and 10,000 tonnes of No.2 or better U.S. yellow soybeans, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The tender specifies shipment from the U.S. Gulf or the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>Shipment Tonnage  Date/Location</p>
<p>			 U.S. Gulf	Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn     20,000   Feb 5-Feb 20   Feb 21-March 5</p>
<p> Soybean  10,000   Feb 5-Feb 20   Feb 21-March 5</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
